---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL, GITHUB_ISSUES_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Base title="Support" description="How to reach the people behind the Pickleballers app.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p>Pickleballers is built by one person and tested by one league, so you'll hear back from the person who wrote it.</p>
    {SUPPORT_EMAIL ? (
      <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    ) : (
      <p>Open an issue on <a href={GITHUB_ISSUES_URL}>the site's GitHub page</a>, or watch this page for an email address once the app is on the App Store.</p>
    )}
    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <p>The <a href="/guides/">guides</a> cover how the score is called, how the rankings work and how to run a night. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a> says what the app stores.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
